OL,3,GNEWSAProsecutors drop case over home
OL,4,A'rocket launcher'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCriminal charges which followed the
OL,7,Fdiscovery of an alleged rocket launcher
OL,8,Fat a property have been dropped.
OL,10,FResidents in Christchurch, Dorset, were
OL,11,Fforced to leave their homes for four
OL,12,Fdays after police cordoned off an
OL,13,Faddress in Suffolk Avenue early on 15
OL,14,FJune.
OL,16,FJohn Davis, 61, Jacqueline Davis, 60,
OL,17,Fand James Davis, 33, were charged with
OL,18,Foffences including making explosives
OL,19,Fwith intent to endanger life or
OL,20,Fproperty.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,334,330,200,160,0,100
