OL,3,GNEWSAProsecutors drop case over home
OL,4,A'rocket launcher'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey remain charged with firearms
OL,7,Foffences, but prosecutors said the
OL,8,Fexplosives charges including the
OL,9,Falleged rocket-propelled grenade (RPG)
OL,10,Fdevice had been discontinued.
